Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Daniel-Fuerst/hitokoto
Description: native single-file hybrid Markdown editor
 hitokoto edits one Markdown file at a time with a hybrid live preview: the
 syntax of headings, emphasis, lists, links, code blocks and tables is hidden
 and shown again where the cursor is.
 .
 It is a native Qt 6 Widgets application and saves the file byte for byte.
